#NEXUS

[ gauthier1986a_fig8: Dinosaur summary cladogram, fully resolved. Each clade name is printed under the backbone just past a node and names the clade the following segment leads to (Dinosauria excludes Herrerasauridae here); Dinosauria, Saurischia, Theropoda, Tetanurae, Coelurosauria and Maniraptora are kept as internal labels on those nodes. 8 tips, fully resolved; 6 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261122). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=8;
    TAXLABELS
        Herrerasauridae
        Ornithischia
        Sauropodomorpha
        Ceratosauria
        Carnosauria
        Ornithomimidae
        Deinonychosauria
        Avialae
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE gauthier1986a_fig8 = [&R] (Herrerasauridae,(Ornithischia,(Sauropodomorpha,(Ceratosauria,(Carnosauria,(Ornithomimidae,(Deinonychosauria,Avialae)Maniraptora)Coelurosauria)Tetanurae)Theropoda)Saurischia)Dinosauria);
END;
